  "text": "WHO Clinical Guidelines on Common Cold and Upper Respiratory Self-Care | Publisher: World \nSection 4: Infection Control & Hygiene Guidelines\nPreventing the spread of upper respiratory viruses protects family and\ncommunity health. Key Prevention Steps: - Cover coughs and sneezes with a\nelbow or tissue. - Wash hands thoroughly with soap and water after\ncoughing or sneezing. - Avoid close contact with vulnerable individuals\nduring acute respiratory symptoms.\nPage 4 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
